| NRR (Net Revenue Retention) | 118% | 114% |

## Notes to Financial Statements

1. Revenue is recognized on ASC 606 subscription basis. 92% of revenue is recurring.
2. Customer concentration: Top 5 customers represent 31% of revenue (risk factor; see key risks memo).
3. Deferred revenue increase of $2.1M YoY reflects accelerating annual prepayments from enterprise customers.
4. Long-term debt: $4.2M venture debt facility, matures December 2027, interest rate 8.5%.
5. No goodwill: TargetCo has not made acquisitions.
